{# This Is My Jam social recovery — the original likes + comments each jam received on thisismyjam.com (2012–2015), recovered from the Internet Archive Wayback Machine. These are NOT live webmentions: a dedicated, honestly-framed render that REUSES the webmentions facepile + h-cite card styling (webmentions.css).

   Placed OUTSIDE the post's h-entry root (same as received webmentions on note/photo/post) so the h-cite cards don't nest as children of the entry.

   Data: src/_data/jamSocial.json keyed by `page.fileSlug` (the exact import filename — see _local/generated/timj-import/build_jam_social.py). Avatars are self-hosted under /assets/images/jams-social/; unrecoverable ones fall back to meta.webmentions.fallbackAvatar.

   Bare include from jam.njk, ZERO shortcodes (plain <img eleventy:ignore> only) — interlinker-safe, so the inner {% if %}/{% for %} blocks render fine. #}

{% set social = jamSocial[page.fileSlug] %}

{% if social and (social.likes | length or social.comments | length) %}
  <aside class="webmentions | wrapper flow region prose">
    <h2 id="thisismyjam">From This Is My Jam</h2>
    <p class="text-step-min-1">
      The likes and comments this jam received on This Is My Jam (2012–2015),
      recovered from the
      <a href="https://web.archive.org/" rel="noreferrer">Internet Archive</a>.
    </p>

    {% if social.likes | length %}
      <div class="flow">
        <h3>{{ social.likes | length }} Like{% if social.likes | length != 1 %}s{% endif %}</h3>
        <ul class="avatars | cluster gutter-3xs" role="list">
          {% for like in social.likes %}
            <li>
              <a class="h-card u-url no-indicator" href="{{ like.url }}" rel="noreferrer">
                <img
                  eleventy:ignore
                  class="u-photo"
                  src="{{ like.photo or (meta.webmentions.fallbackAvatar | url) }}"
                  alt=""
                  width="40"
                  height="40"
                  loading="lazy"
                />
                <span class="visually-hidden p-name">{{ like.name }}</span>
              </a>
            </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if social.comments | length %}
      <div class="flow">
        <h3>{{ social.comments | length }} Comment{% if social.comments | length != 1 %}s{% endif %}</h3>
        <ul class="webmention-list | flow" role="list">
          {% for comment in social.comments %}
            <li>
              <article class="webmention h-cite | flow">
                <div class="webmention__meta | cluster">
                  <a
                    class="webmention__author p-author h-card u-url no-indicator"
                    href="{{ comment.url }}"
                    rel="noreferrer"
                  >
                    <img
                      eleventy:ignore
                      class="u-photo"
                      src="{{ comment.photo or (meta.webmentions.fallbackAvatar | url) }}"
                      alt=""
                      width="48"
                      height="48"
                      loading="lazy"
                    />
                    <strong class="p-name">{{ comment.name }}</strong>
                  </a>

                  {% if comment.date %}
                    <time class="webmention__date" datetime="{{ comment.date }}" title="Approximate date">
                      {{ comment.date | formatDate('MMM YYYY') }}
                    </time>
                  {% endif %}
                </div>

                <div class="webmention__text p-content | flow">
                  <p>{{ comment.text }}</p>
                  {% for link in comment.links %}
                    <p class="text-step-min-1"><a href="{{ link }}" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ link }}</a></p>
                  {% endfor %}
                </div>
              </article>
            </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </aside>
{% endif %}
